    </section>

    <section class="sculptia-row">
      <div class="sculptia-row-image"><img src="{{ 'sculptia-heather-grey.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Circulation" loading="lazy"></div>
      <div class="sculptia-row-copy">
        <p class="sculptia-eyebrow">CIRCULATION</p>
        <h2>Fabric that massages with every move</h2>
        <ul class="sculptia-rich-list">
          <li><strong>Without Sculptia.</strong> Sluggish circulation, stubborn cellulite.</li>
          <li><strong>With Sculptia.</strong> Boosted circulation, smoother skin.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="sculptia-row sculptia-row-reverse">
      <div class="sculptia-row-image"><img src="{{ 'sculptia-navy.png' | asset_url }}" alt="The waistband" loading="lazy"></div>
      <div class="sculptia-row-copy">
        <p class="sculptia-eyebrow">THE WAISTBAND</p>
        <h2>High waist, flat tummy</h2>
        <p>The wide waistband holds your tummy gently in place and shapes your silhouette — without ever rolling down.</p>
        <ul class="sculptia-check-list">
          <li>✓ Gentle, secure hold</li>
          <li>✓ Never rolls, never slips</li>
          <li>✓ Naturally flattering shape</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="sculptia-row">
      <div class="sculptia-row-image"><img src="{{ 'sculptia-charcoal.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Your skin" loading="lazy"></div>
      <div class="sculptia-row-copy">
        <p class="sculptia-eyebrow">YOUR SKIN</p>
        <h2>Visibly smoother-looking skin</h2>
        <p>The textured mesh stimulates your skin with every move. The look of dimpled skin visibly fades.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    {%- comment -%} Timeline {%- endcomment -%}
    <section class="sculptia-timeline">
      <div><div class="sculptia-timeline-t">Day 1</div><div class="sculptia-timeline-d">Instant lift</div></div>
      <div><div class="sculptia-timeline-t">2 Weeks</div><div class="sculptia-timeline-d">Firmer skin</div></div>
      <div><div class="sculptia-timeline-t">4 Weeks</div><div class="sculptia-timeline-d">Smoother look</div></div>
    </section>

    {%- comment -%} Feature grid {%- endcomment -%}
    <section class="sculptia-features">
      <div class="sculptia-features-grid">
        <div class="sculptia-feature-card"><h3>Never rolls down</h3><p>Stays put, even in a squat.</p></div>
        <div class="sculptia-feature-card"><h3>100% opaque</h3><p>Zero see-through, squat-tested.</p></div>
        <div class="sculptia-feature-card"><h3>No annoying seams</h3><p>No chafing, no pinching.</p></div>
        <div class="sculptia-feature-card"><h3>Breathable</h3><p>Wicks moisture, dries fast.</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    {%- comment -%} Everyday wear {%- endcomment -%}
    <section class="sculptia-row">
      <div class="sculptia-row-image"><img src="{{ 'sculptia-lifestyle-office.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Everyday wear" loading="lazy"></div>
      <div class="sculptia-row-copy">
        <p class="sculptia-eyebrow">EVERYDAY WEAR</p>
        <h2>From workouts to everyday life</h2>
        <p>Wear it with sneakers or boots, from morning yoga to Sunday brunch.</p>
        <div class="sculptia-tags">
          <span>WORKOUT</span><span>OFFICE</span><span>TRAVEL</span><span>CITY</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    {%- comment -%} Material {%- endcomment -%}
    <section class="sculptia-material">
      <h2>Sculpting without sacrificing comfort</h2>
      <p>70% nylon, 30% spandex — a second-skin fabric you'll forget you're wearing.</p>
    </section>

    {%- comment -%} Final CTA {%- endcomment -%}
    <section class="sculptia-dark sculptia-final-cta">
      <h2>Ready to reveal your shape?</h2>
      <p>Buy 2 get 1 FREE today · Free shipping over {{ selected_variant.compare_at_price | default: selected_variant.price | money_without_trailing_zeros }} · 30-day refund</p>
      <a href="#sculptia-top" class="sculptia-cta-btn">CHOOSE MY BUNDLE</a>
    </section>

    {%- comment -%} Reviews {%- endcomment -%}
    <section id="sculptia-reviews" class="sculptia-reviews">
